        "original_id": "56bae041-e59a-5ae0-a740-99ca148ac9e1",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Billy Donovan, Lewis Preston\n- Organizations: Oklahoma City Thunder, Pennsylvania State University, Coastal Carolina University, University of Notre Dame, University of Florida, Kennesaw State Owls\n- Events: 2013–14 Kennesaw State Owls men's basketball season, 2015–16 Oklahoma City Thunder season\n- Places: KSU Convocation Center\n- Concepts: NBA, Atlantic Sun Conference, Western Conference, Northwest Division\n\nFacts:\n- In the 2013–14 season, Lewis Preston was the third-year head coach of the Kennesaw State Owls men's basketball team.\n- In the 2013–14 season, the Kennesaw State Owls played their home games at the KSU Convocation Center and competed in the Atlantic Sun Conference.\n- Lewis Preston previously served as an assistant men's basketball coach at Pennsylvania State University, Coastal Carolina University, the University of Notre Dame, and the University of Florida under Billy Donovan.\n- Billy Donovan, born on May 30, 1965, is an American professional basketball coach.\n- In the 2015–16 season, after missing the playoffs the previous year, the Oklahoma City Thunder won the Northwest Division and secured the third seed in the Western Conference.\n- Billy Donovan was the head coach of the Oklahoma City Thunder in the National Basketball Association.",
